 content of a map — not only the overlays atop the map, but also"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the content that forms the base map."}],"title":"MLNShape","fragments":[{"text":"MLNShape","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNComputedShapeSourceDataSource":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlncomputedshapesourcedatasource","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNComputedShapeSourceDataSource","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Data source for "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNComputedShapeSource","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". This protocol defines two optional methods for fetching"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"data, one based on tile coordinates, and one based on a bounding box. Classes that implement this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"protocol must implement one, and only one of the methods. Methods on this protocol will not be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"called on main thread, they will be called on the caller’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"requestQueue"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"title":"MLNComputedShapeSourceDataSource","fragments":[{"text":"MLNComputedShapeSourceDataSource","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNComputedShapeSource/requestQueue":{"fragments":[{"text":"requestQueue","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"requestQueue","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlncomputedshapesource\/requestqueue","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNComputedShapeSource\/requestQueue","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A queue that calls to the data source will be made on."}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNComputedShapeSource":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentatio